exports[`contact > has one h1, the section headings, and no skipped levels 1`] = `"Contact UsLast updated: 2/22/2026Need help? We're here.SupportFor account, subscription, challenge, or redemption questions:support@wanderbite.comPrivacyFor privacy requests (access, deletion, or a copy of your data) or privacy questions:privacy@wanderbite.comMailing AddressDevine Enterprises LLC d/b/a Wanderbite5900 Balcones Drive #23572Austin, TX 78731, USAResponse TimesWe aim to respond within 2 business days. Response times may be longer during holidays or high-volume periods."`;

