exports[`rules > has one h1, the section headings, and no skipped levels 1`] = `"Discount & Challenge RulesLast updated: 2/22/2026These rules explain how Wanderbite challenges, swaps, and discounts work. By using Wanderbite, you agree to follow these rules along with our Terms of Service.Monthly Plan BenefitsYour subscription includes 2 challenges per month and 1 swap per month. Challenges and swaps reset monthly and do not roll over unless Wanderbite explicitly states otherwise.How Challenges WorkEach month, Wanderbite assigns you challenges to help you discover participating restaurants. Challenge availability may vary based on restaurant participation, capacity, and eligibility rules (including cooldowns).Swap RulesYou may use one (1) swap per month to replace one assigned challenge. A swap replaces a challenge; it does not add an extra challenge. Unused swaps do not roll over.Discount Terms (Default)Each challenge shows its discount and minimum spend. Unless a specific challenge states otherwise:The discount and minimum spend shown on the challenge applyThe minimum spend is calculated before tax and tipNot stackable: cannot be combined with other promotions, coupons, happy hour discounts, loyalty rewards, or other offers unless the restaurant explicitly allows itIn-person confirmation required at the time of purchase using the method shown in the appRestaurant Participation and AvailabilityRestaurants are independent third parties. Participation, hours, menus, and discount availability may change at any time. Wanderbite does not guarantee that a specific restaurant, cuisine, or location will be available in a given month.Cooldowns and Participation LimitsTo help distribute visits fairly and prevent misuse:6-month cooldown: After redeeming a discount at a restaurant, you cannot redeem another discount at that same restaurant for 6 monthsRolling 12-month cap: Maximum of 2 redemptions at the same restaurant within any rolling 12-month periodFair Use / Anti-AbuseOne account per personDo not attempt to redeem discounts outside the redemption flow, manipulate check-ins, or create duplicate accountsWanderbite may limit, suspend, or terminate access for suspected fraud or abuseQuestionsContact: support@wanderbite.comCompany: Devine Enterprises LLC d/b/a WanderbiteMailing Address: 5900 Balcones Drive #23572, Austin, TX 78731, USASee also our Terms of Service and Privacy Policy."`;

